{
  "$schema": "https://openapi.vercel.sh/vercel.json",
  "version": 2,

  "//": [
    "AURA-EVAL backend — TWO-PROJECT deploy.",
    "Set the Vercel project's Root Directory to `backend`. The frontend is a",
    "separate project rooted at `frontend` (see frontend/vercel.json).",
    "",
    "Note: `functions` cannot be combined with `builds`, so memory and",
    "maxDuration are declared inside builds[].config.",
    "",
    "With this layout the two services are on different origins, so the",
    "frontend must set NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL and this project must set",
    "CORS_ORIGINS to the frontend URL. The single-project manifest at the",
    "repo root avoids both by sharing one origin."
  ],

  "builds": [
    {
      "src": "api/index.py",
      "use": "@vercel/python",
      "config": {
        "runtime": "python3.12",
        "maxLambdaSize": "45mb",
        "memory": 1024,
        "maxDuration": 60
      }
    }
  ],

  "routes": [
    {
      "src": "/api/health(?:/.*)?",
      "dest": "api/index.py",
      "headers": { "Cache-Control": "no-store, max-age=0" }
    },
    {
      "src": "/api/runs/[^/]+/stream",
      "dest": "api/index.py",
      "headers": {
        "Cache-Control": "no-store, no-transform",
        "X-Accel-Buffering": "no"
      }
    },
    {
      "src": "/(.*)",
      "dest": "api/index.py"
    }
  ],

  "crons": [
    {
      "path": "/api/internal/tick",
      "schedule": "*/1 * * * *"
    }
  ]
}
